  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "In twenty twenty-three, Juventus earned a top-four place on the pitch, and lost it in a courtroom.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "title",
        "heading": "PLUSVALENZA",
        "sub": "Juventus · 2022-23",
        "pill": "FOOTBALL'S BIGGEST SCANDALS",
        "person": "allegri"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The case was about capital gains on player transfers, around sixty million euros of them, booked in the accounts.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "Plusvalenza",
        "body": "Italian for capital gain. The case: transfer gains booked in Juventus's accounts, about €60m, judged false by Italian football's courts."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "January: the Italian federation docks Juve fifteen points.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stats",
        "title": "January 2023",
        "items": [
          {
            "n": "-15",
            "l": "points"
          }
        ],
        "person": "allegri"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "April: Italy's top sports court sends it back for a rethink. The points come back.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "vlahovic",
        "label": "POINTS RESTORED… FOR NOW",
        "mood": "happy"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Twenty-second of May: the new verdict. Minus ten.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stamp",
        "text": "-10 POINTS",
        "color": "red",
        "person": "allegri"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Final table: Juventus sixty-two points, seventh.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "list",
        "title": "Serie A 2022-23",
        "rows": [
          {
            "name": "Napoli",
            "value": "90",
            "club": "nap"
